# Blog save labels

The title chip on a post (and the index row for that post) is **Save Article** / **Saved Article**. That is `SaveButton` with `kind="blog"` — do not pass a custom idle label that says only Save.

In-article hall/hours chips are **Save Info** / **Saved Info**. That is `ListingSaveButton`. Do not relabel those as Save Article.

Markets and stalls elsewhere stay **Save** / **Saved**.
